@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam dpi 150
left to right direction
title DGM-USECASE-06 后台审核与审计
actor "有权管理员" as Admin
rectangle "CognitaNexus" {
 usecase "UC-17 后台待办与审计" as Audit
 usecase "UC-06 审核认领" as Review
 usecase "UC-09 核验成果数据" as Work
 usecase "UC-10 核验身份与归属" as Identity
}
Admin -- Audit
Admin -- Review
Admin -- Work
Admin -- Identity
note bottom
当前V1.1；角色关系表示职责，不用继承表达账号状态。
认证及授权为守卫，不画作强制调用用例。O01/O02延期。
end note
@enduml
